# A carousel: the bumpers cycle, A picks.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/menus.padpack Menus
tap start 30
advance 100
tap rb 30
tap rb 30
tap south 30
advance 100
---
overlay menu "Carousel" selected "One"   @0
sound menu Open pop                      @0
sound menu Step click                    @130
overlay menu "Carousel" selected "Two"   @130
sound menu Step click                    @160
overlay menu "Carousel" selected "Three" @160
sound menu Pick pop                      @190
overlay none                             @190
sound menu Close pop                     @190
key KEY_T down                           @190
key KEY_T up                             @190
